        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For ACST's in progression, the Company will conduct an annual developmental review regarding skill proficiency progress and training needs. For any ACST with fifteen (15) or more years of Installation Service or any CST with twenty (20) years or more of Installation Service who is not recommended for reassignment, a developmental plan will be established by the Board.",
            "block_bbox": [
